<title>USA: Omaha cattle steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers were steady in active trade, said the USDA.</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4, 1100-1350 lbs 70.50-72.00, few shipments 72.50. Select 63.00-71.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Select to mainly Choice 2-4, 1000-1150 lbs 70.00-72.50. Select including occasional Commerical 63.00-70.50.</p>
</text>
